{"5442520":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Blocade","steam_appid":5442520,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5442910],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn. Hard to outthink.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn you do one thing: move your pawn one step, or place a wall. First to reach the far side wins. Walls slow your rival down, but a path must always stay open, so the whole game is deciding when a wall is worth more than a step.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranked against real people<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 ranked matches with a rating, leagues and a leaderboard<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player pool with the Blocade mobile apps, so there is always a game<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time controls from quick to relaxed, and a rematch when you want revenge<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Royale, every day<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 128-player knockout starts at 12:00 UTC every day. Entry is free. Win your board, move up the bracket, and the last player standing takes the crown.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knockouts with your friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a private 4 to 16 player knockout and share the code. Friends join for free.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A ladder of bots<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computer opponents with their own styles, from a gentle first game to the Nightshift crew at the top. Keep a daily streak to unlock the hardest tiers.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get better every day<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily puzzles with a streak to protect<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game review that replays your match and shows the move it turned on<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrated tutorial and five coaches to learn from<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass &amp; Play for two people at one screen<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blocade Plus (optional)<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocade is free to play, with no ads. Blocade Plus is a one-time DLC purchase:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited ranked matches<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full review and analysis after every game<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reserved seat in every Royale<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host your own Knockouts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited hints and takebacks in Assisted mode<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every board theme and the full quick-chat tray<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn. Hard to outthink.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn you do one thing: move your pawn one step, or place a wall. First to reach the far side wins. Walls slow your rival down, but a path must always stay open, so the whole game is deciding when a wall is worth more than a step.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranked against real people<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1 ranked matches with a rating, leagues and a leaderboard<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player pool with the Blocade mobile apps, so there is always a game<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time controls from quick to relaxed, and a rematch when you want revenge<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Royale, every day<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 128-player knockout starts at 12:00 UTC every day. Entry is free. Win your board, move up the bracket, and the last player standing takes the crown.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knockouts with your friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a private 4 to 16 player knockout and share the code. Friends join for free.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A ladder of bots<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computer opponents with their own styles, from a gentle first game to the Nightshift crew at the top. Keep a daily streak to unlock the hardest tiers.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get better every day<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily puzzles with a streak to protect<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game review that replays your match and shows the move it turned on<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrated tutorial and five coaches to learn from<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass &amp; Play for two people at one screen<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blocade Plus (optional)<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocade is free to play, with no ads. Blocade Plus is a one-time DLC purchase:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited ranked matches<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full review and analysis after every game<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reserved seat in every Royale<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host your own Knockouts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited hints and takebacks in Assisted mode<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every board theme and the full quick-chat tray<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Race your pawn across the board and drop walls to cut off your rival, but never seal them in. Blocade is a free two-player strategy board game: ranked matches against real people on PC and mobile, a daily 128-player tournament, puzzles and a ladder of bots.","supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5442520\/b2ea2e008194afd028c587e20cf9f4d1f3693b20\/header.jpg?t=1793735421","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5442520\/a4f19320b9885bc6adca9c3b30b225c1886f6a7a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793735421","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5442520\/a4f19320b9885bc6adca9c3b30b225c1886f6a7a\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793735421","website":"https:\/\/playblocade.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any GPU with WebGL support<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 Monterey or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"© 2026 Chuvex, LLC. All rights reserved","developers":["Byk3y Studios"],"publishers":["Byk3y Studios"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_asse